@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_7_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge1-4-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR15,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那就再来<br>认真想一想<br>杀死诺亚的凶器的事吧！|#0101Trial04_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……有讨论的必要吗？<br>刚刚樱羽和宝生<br>不是讲过了吗……<br>说那支箭就是<br>杀死城崎的凶器。<br>|#0101Trial04_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你是说……<br>掉落在房间里的箭矢？<br>诺亚应该就是<br>被这支箭刺中胸口<br>死掉的，对吧……？|#0101Trial04_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR1_1,ArmL14,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那、那么<br>凶手究竟是<br>怎么插<br>这支箭的呢……？|#0101Trial04_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR1_1,ArmL14,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:房间里涂满了<br>纯白的颜料，<br>上面也没发现<br>有足迹。|#0101Trial04_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"难道不是<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_04_01\">从远处投掷</link>的吗。<br>凶手应该有<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_04_02\">投掷飞镖的经验</link>吧。<br>|#0101Trial04_Alisa002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"只是<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_04_03\">从房间外投掷进去</link>而已……<br>答案就是这么简单好懂。|#0101Trial04_Alisa003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……说什么飞镖杀人，<br>你认真的吗？<br>脑子没问题吧？|#0101Trial04_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,50 Roll:-2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:我这是假设……！<br>先假设是这么回事<br>再来展开！<br>有意见的话你来讲啊！|#0101Trial04_Alisa004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:true ProcessTimer:true
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

