[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……！<br>我要和亚里沙<br>认真讲清楚才行……！|#0101Trial04_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0.2 Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Nervous_Closed
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:（……虽然我还有一点害怕）|#0101Trial04_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true Wait:true

@GotoModified Path:.Judge1-4-1

